<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Bedava Günlük Kazançlar</title>

<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}

body{
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#070b14,#111827,#090d18);
color:#fff;
min-height:100vh;
}

.top{
text-align:center;
padding:12px;
background:rgba(0,0,0,.35);
color:#b9c2d0;
font-size:14px;
border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)
}

.top b{color:#00ff88}

.hero{
text-align:center;
padding:55px 20px 30px;
}

.logo{font-size:55px;margin-bottom:12px}

h1{
font-size:clamp(32px,8vw,58px);
font-weight:900;
background:linear-gradient(90deg,#00ff88,#00c8ff,#a855f7);
-webkit-background-clip:text;
color:transparent;
margin-bottom:15px;
}

.hero p{
max-width:650px;
margin:auto;
color:#aeb7c5;
font-size:17px;
line-height:1.6;
}

.stats{
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
gap:12px;
flex-wrap:wrap;
padding:10px 20px 35px;
}

.stat{
background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
border-radius:16px;
padding:15px 25px;
text-align:center;
min-width:125px;
}

.stat strong{
display:block;
font-size:25px;
color:#00ff88;
}

.stat span{
font-size:12px;
color:#9ca3af;
}

.section{
max-width:1050px;
margin:auto;
padding:0 20px 60px;
}

.section h2{
font-size:27px;
margin-bottom:7px;
}

.section>p{
color:#8f99a8;
margin-bottom:22px;
}

.cards{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));
gap:20px;
}

.card{
background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,.09),rgba(255,255,255,.035));
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
border-radius:22px;
padding:28px 22px;
transition:.3s;
box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
}

.card:hover{
transform:translateY(-7px);
border-color:#00ff88;
}

.icon{
font-size:48px;
margin-bottom:15px;
}

.card h3{
font-size:24px;
margin-bottom:10px;
}

.card p{
color:#aab2bf;
line-height:1.6;
min-height:52px;
}

.badge{
display:inline-block;
margin:17px 0 12px;
padding:6px 11px;
border-radius:20px;
background:rgba(0,255,136,.1);
color:#00ff88;
font-size:12px;
font-weight:bold;
}

.btn{
display:block;
text-align:center;
text-decoration:none;
background:#00ff88;
color:#06100b;
font-weight:900;
padding:15px;
border-radius:12px;
transition:.25s;
}

.btn:hover{
transform:scale(1.03);
filter:brightness(1.12);
}

.blue{background:#00c8ff}
.purple{background:#a855f7;color:white}

.notice{
margin:30px auto 0;
max-width:700px;
text-align:center;
padding:20px;
border-radius:18px;
background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
color:#929baa;
line-height:1.5;
}

.notice b{color:white}

footer{
border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
text-align:center;
padding:25px 15px;
color:#687181;
font-size:13px;
}

@media(max-width:600px){
.hero{padding-top:38px}
h1{font-size:34px}
.hero p{font-size:15px}
.stats{padding-bottom:30px}
.stat{min-width:105px;padding:12px}
.stat strong{font-size:21px}
.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="top">
⚡ <b>Yeni fırsatlar her gün ekleniyor!</b>
</div>

<section class="hero">
<div class="logo">💰</div>

<h1>BEDAVA GÜNLÜK KAZANÇLAR</h1>

<p>
Telefonundan yeni kazanç fırsatlarını keşfet.
Güncel platformları tek bir yerde incele.
</p>
</section>

<div class="stats">

<div class="stat">
<strong>3</strong>
<span>Aktif Fırsat</span>
</div>

<div class="stat">
<strong>24/7</strong>
<span>Güncel</span>
</div>

<div class="stat">
<strong>📱</strong>
<span>Mobil Uyumlu</span>
</div>

</div>

<section class="section">

<h2>🔥 Bugünün Fırsatları</h2>
<p>İncelemek istediğin fırsatı seç ve platforma geç.</p>

<div class="cards">

<!-- TRONPICK -->
<div class="card">
<div class="icon">🪙</div>

<h3>TronPick</h3>

<p>
TRON tabanlı platformu incele ve mevcut
fırsatları keşfet.
</p>

<div class="badge">🟢 AKTİF</div>

<a
href="https://tronpick.io/?ref=Brainfreei"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener noreferrer"
class="btn">
HEMEN BAŞLA →
</a>
</div>


<!-- BIRDS EMPIRE -->
<div class="card">
<div class="icon">🐦</div>

<h3>Birds Empire</h3>

<p>
Telegram üzerinden oyuna katıl ve
platformu keşfet.
</p>

<div class="badge">🔵 TELEGRAM</div>

<a
href="https://t.me/BirdsEmpireBot?start=2109000"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener noreferrer"
class="btn blue">
TELEGRAM'DA AÇ →
</a>
</div>


<!-- AI LAB -->
<div class="card">
<div class="icon">🤖</div>

<h3>AI Lab</h3>

<p>
Yapay zekâ tabanlı platformu incele ve
nasıl çalıştığını keşfet.
</p>

<div class="badge">🟣 YENİ</div>

<a
href="https://t.me/AiLab_robot?start=583981"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener noreferrer"
class="btn purple">
HEMEN BAŞLA →
</a>
</div>

</div>

<div class="notice">
✨ <b>Yeni fırsatlar düzenli olarak eklenmektedir.</b>
<br>
Platformlara katılmadan önce kendi şartlarını ve kullanım koşullarını kontrol et.
</div>

</section>

<footer>
© 2026 Bedava Günlük Kazançlar
<br><br>
Güncel fırsatlar • Mobil uyumlu • Her gün yeni içerik
</footer>

</body>
</html>
